# Runs before every push — the last check before code leaves your machine.
#
# These cover the whole project, not just changed files: a rename in one file can
# break a caller in another that lint-staged never looked at.
#
# Same checks CI runs, so a red pipeline should be rare — you find out here first,
# in seconds, instead of waiting on an agent.
#
# In a genuine emergency: git push --no-verify
npm run typecheck
npm run test:verify
